    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπρο-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰγ</span>], only in pf.
		
			Pass.
		, mostly part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπροηγμένα</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in</i>
			
			<i>the second rank,</i> of things neither good nor bad, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγμένα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.48
			</span></i>; the distn. was rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Aristo
			</span></i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.83
			</span></i>, but cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.29
			</span></i>, al.: inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆχθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristo
				</span></i>
			 l.c.</div>
